{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Were the snipers waiting for *your* movements?\"","created_at":"2021-07-19T23:52:40.346000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-20T00:01:46.960000Z","id":"866829930472669204","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"The figure chuckles lightly. \"If you'll forgive the caution, I really would like you to take a drink first. Once I trust you, we can talk fully.\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:04:05.442000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866832803974479873","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"He drinks","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:04:42.377000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866832958890311740","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"It tastes good, and you feel a slight buzzing feeling. For the next hour you are unable to lie to this individual.","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:05:50.481000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866833244539846697","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"The figure nods. \"What name do you go by?\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:06:24.512000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866833387276599296","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Finn Midask, sometimes Captain Finn when I'm in the air. George Washington I presume?\" he extends a hand to shake","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:08:18.730000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866833866340827186","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"The figure extends a hand to shake, and chuckles again. \"Not quite, but that's an understandable assumption. Do you or have you ever worked for the British crown? If so, when and what was your job?\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:10:21.503000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866834381288767490","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"My apologies for the mistake then. And yes, I have an alter ego I use to siphon secret information from the Gazette that they try to censor. Journalist is probably the correct title for it, although my papers in are expired, they dumped everyone to keep something big under wraps.\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:12:34.740000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866834940124725268","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"The figure nods. \"Are you willing to do whatever is in your power to help the rebellion and throw off the tyrrany of the British, including great sacrifice?\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:15:45.904000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866835741924392960","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"I've been in this fight since I was 9 years old.\" he nods","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:16:19.499000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866835882833346632","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"The figure smiles. \"The name's Trapero. Welcome aboard, Captain Finn.\" They pause for a minute, before taking another sip from their mug. \"Now then, I take it you'd like to meet the general himself?\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:20:37.239000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-20T00:23:45.165000Z","id":"866836963872866304","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"It would be an honor to see the general that has inspired so many including myself\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:21:56.034000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866837294361870336","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Trapero nods. \"He's quite the figure. I can't arrange a meeting right away, but it should be possible later.\" They are silent, holding their mug in both hands. \"Is there anything else you wished to discuss? I believe we're being watched and I'd hate to have to depart and leave you with important questions.\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:27:15.304000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866838633478488094","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"Watched by whom exactly? This place is usually protected by an alarm spell to prevent any traitors to the cause from entering without the alarm going off\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:28:34.634000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866838966213148722","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"No magic is perfect. And besides, I'm pretty sure they're watching from outside.\" They take the final glugs from their drink. \"Was there anything else?\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:31:21.568000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866839666383388702","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"\"When can we expect to hold an organized strike back at the red coats?\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:32:29.873000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866839952875978792","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"Trapero exhales deeply. \"That's the big question, isn't it? If I had to guess, sometime within the next two weeks.\" They pause, stretching their arms and legs. \"Intel is tricky, which makes planning fickle. So I can't give you a firm answer, but I can say this: plan every day like it could happen tomorrow.\" They smile. \"It was a pleasure to meet you, Finn.\" They extend a hand and stand up.","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:46:39.245000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866843515401273365","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"He shakes the hand, \"The pleasure is all mine. Take care\"","created_at":"2021-07-20T00:49:42.041000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866844282102349854","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"865913981406806046","content":"They do a small bow. \"Now, if you'll excuse me, I believe some gentlemen outside are big fans of General Washington.\" They smile and head outside the door, before blowing a kiss to a nearby rooftop and running around a corner cloaked in shadow.","created_at":"2021-07-20T01:28:52.686000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866854141422993418","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
